<title>USA: Triborough Authority, N.Y., $201 mln deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Triborough Authority, N.Y., $201 mln deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced Triborough Bridge and Tunnel Authority, N.Y.'s $200.9 million bond deal, lowering yields five basis points in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2027 to 5.60 percent from 5.65 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>TRIBOROUGH BRIDGE AND TUNNEL AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $200,930,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL PURPOSE REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996B</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>   MOODY'S: Aa		    S&amp;P: A+		    FITCH: AA</p>
<p>   DATED: 11/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
